# P0.2 — there is an actual bug in the authored state machine

This condition:

```python
{"op": "gt",
 "lhs": "self_integrity",
 "threshold": 0.0}
→ recover
```

is commented as:

> reached only if integrity low

but it means:

```text
if integrity > 0
```

which is true almost the entire time the blade is alive.

So once `pressure` is entered, unless the preceding distance transition wins, the machine immediately moves to `recover`.

It presumably intended something like:

```text
self_integrity < 30
```

