# What I would *not* change

Several architectural decisions should now be treated as settled unless evidence forces revision:

**Keep the LLM out of the physics loop.** The `ReincarnationRuntime` approach is exactly right.

**Keep mechanical reveal before reincarnation.** That is still one of the strongest mechanics in the entire project.

**Keep Agent ≠ Reincarnation ≠ Body ≠ Daimon.**

**Keep simulation truth upstream of story/media.**

