# The most important finding

The project now has the correct three-stage intelligence architecture:

```text
PERSISTENT INTELLIGENCE
        ↓
SELF-COMPILATION
        ↓
LIVE EXECUTABLE INTELLIGENCE
```

That's excellent.

But today stage two is still:

```text
hand-authored deterministic heuristic
```

rather than:

```text
persistent AI strategically writes itself
```

and the exact self it creates is not yet cryptographically bound into the canonical match.

**Fix those two things and the defining RoboBladez mechanic becomes real in the strongest sense, not merely architectural.**

Likewise on visuals, the system has the right ontology—but until `mechanical_version` participates in resolution and the full-stack harness actually uses the asset library, it isn't yet safe to say that the visual canon automatically stays coupled to gameplay canon.

So I would characterize `2bfe2aa` as:

> **Architecture complete enough to stop designing horizontally. Now harden the vertical truth paths.**

That is a very good place for the repo to be.
